 /*
- * Qualcomm wrapper registers ("QSCRATCH"). The controller only connects
- * (pull-up on D+) while it sees a valid VBUS session; Linux dwc3-qcom
- * forces that in software when the charger reports a cable
- * (dwc3_qcom_vbus_override_enable). On cliffs there is no separate
- * qscratch reg range: dwc3-qcom.c maps reg[0] (the DWC3 core_base) as the
- * wrapper base and writes the same offsets there.
+ * Qualcomm wrapper registers ("QSCRATCH") live at core_base + 0xf8800 on
+ * peridot (dwc3-msm-core.c QSCRATCH_REG_OFFSET; the DT has only core_base).
+ * The controller only connects (pull-up on D+) while it sees a valid VBUS
+ * session; dwc3_msm_override_vbus_status() forces that in software. It sets
